  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Vairocana Reversal — requires Reverse Cursed Technique. Not added automatically.</em></p><p>At 6th level, you can cause your original created world of rules to expand. At the start of your turn while Cosmic Genesis is active, you can spend 1 CE to gain one of the following benefits.</p>\n<p><strong>Expansion.</strong> The range of Cosmic Genesis increases by 10 ft (to a maximum of 120 ft).</p>\n<p><strong>Addition.</strong> You add a minor rule that functions half as effectively (to a maximum of 3 minor rules).</p>\n<p><strong>Duration.</strong> The duration of Cosmic Genesis increases by 1 round.</p>",
